/E (Behind every successful business lies a series of financial decisions. The Finance Round brings participants into the world of money management, financial strategy, and business decisionmaking, where every choice carries a consequence. Across three rounds, teams will face challenges that test their ability to interpret financial data, manage resources, assess risks, and respond to changing business situations. Each stage will demand sharp analytical thinking, sound judgement, and the confidence to make decisions under pressure. As the challenges unfold, participants must go beyond the numbers, uncover opportunities, navigate uncertainties, and defend their financial strategies before a panel. Step into the decision-maker's seat and discover how well you can turn financial knowledge into business success. )
