/P 74 0 R
/E (The Entrepreneurship Development Department is a platform for individuals who are ready to think beyond conventional ideas and experience what it takes to turn opportunities into real business possibilities. It challenges participants to step into the shoes of entrepreneurs, where creativity, strategic thinking, and practical decision-making come together to shape solutions to real-world business challenges. The activities are designed to test an entrepreneurial mindset through situations that demand more than just theoretical knowledge. Participants will be encouraged to identify opportunities, develop practical ideas, understand business needs, and make decisions while working with limited time and resources. Throughout the challenges, teams and individuals may face unexpected obstacles, changing circumstances, and difficult business decisions. From negotiating deals and managing resources to solving problems and adapting strategies, every task will test their ability to think clearly, take calculated risks, and respond with confidence. The focus is not only on having a good idea, but also on knowing how to develop, defend, and execute it. As participants progress, they will be pushed to look at problems from different perspectives, justify their choices, and communicate their plans effectively. Every decision will matter, and every challenge will offer an opportunity to demonstrate initiative, resilience, leadership, and business understanding. The ability to learn, adapt, and turn challenges into opportunities is what sets an entrepreneur apart. Come experience the world of entrepreneurship, where ideas are only the beginning, decisions create direction, and the ability to turn possibilities into action makes all the difference.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
