/P 75 0 R
/E (The Business Quiz takes participants on a journey through the fascinating stories behind the world's most influential companies, brands, and business leaders. Featuring five distinct rounds, the competition moves beyond conventional business knowledge, challenging participants to uncover the companies behind intriguing historical events, lesser-known facts, milestones, and stories that have shaped the corporate world. From remarkable business decisions and iconic brand journeys to unusual corporate histories, every question offers a glimpse into the events and ideas that have influenced the business landscape. Each question is an opportunity to connect the dots, recognise hidden clues, and discover the history behind familiar names. Participants will be challenged to look beyond what is commonly known, draw connections between seemingly unrelated events, and put their knowledge and observation skills to the test. As the competition progresses, teams will face increasingly engaging challenges that demand quick thinking, accuracy, teamwork, and the ability to make connections under pressure. It is not just about what you know, but how well you observe, interpret, and connect the dots. Beyond testing knowledge, the competition celebrates curiosity and the ability to look at business from a different perspective. Whether it is an iconic brand, a forgotten milestone, or an extraordinary corporate story, every clue brings participants closer to the bigger picture. Get ready to question, connect, and compete in a battle where every detail counts and every answer tells a story. Step into the world of Business Quiz, explore the stories behind the names you know, uncover the facts you don't, and discover what it takes to stay ahead of the competition.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
